{"3846290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doomsday Diner", "steam_appid": 3846290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Be Apart Of Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/52551874342fa2ec2d014e4505f60b6e.avif?t=1787525606\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras_big/52551874342fa2ec2d014e4505f60b6e.avif?t=1787525606 width=1560 height=240 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaos! Cooking! Combat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In a post-apocalyptic world where hot dogs are cheap and life is cheaper, you manage the last functioning hot dog diner. Cook hot dogs, brew coffee and serve bizarre orders. Upgrade your diner keep it clean and shoot down raiders who want your hard-earned cash. How many days can you survive in this job in this roguelike job sim?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/c773aea93082961c8bedb8f83c67c321.poster.avif?t=1787525606\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/c773aea93082961c8bedb8f83c67c321.webm?t=1787525606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/c773aea93082961c8bedb8f83c67c321.mp4?t=1787525606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace physics-based controls as you frantically manage a diner, leading to hilarious and unpredictable outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/3e6a9e875518719b40e5a9380e9b49b9.poster.avif?t=1787525606\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/3e6a9e875518719b40e5a9380e9b49b9.webm?t=1787525606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/3e6a9e875518719b40e5a9380e9b49b9.mp4?t=1787525606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook weird and wacky hotdogs of the apocalypse before orders expire and you become next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/9fe8402776bbcef43995580a163d7f68.poster.avif?t=1787525606\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/9fe8402776bbcef43995580a163d7f68.webm?t=1787525606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/9fe8402776bbcef43995580a163d7f68.mp4?t=1787525606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with your trusty weapon and serve justice against raiders who are after your profits. But don't forget what's on the stove!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/33acbc8993984d9c30002b68945f6e88.poster.avif?t=1787525606\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/33acbc8993984d9c30002b68945f6e88.webm?t=1787525606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/33acbc8993984d9c30002b68945f6e88.mp4?t=1787525606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment and diner to deal with the increasing chaos of the apocalypse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose Upgrades for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Diner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Handy Weapon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/968f015aa212dca047a77c01e8b50ddf.poster.avif?t=1787525606\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/968f015aa212dca047a77c01e8b50ddf.webm?t=1787525606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/968f015aa212dca047a77c01e8b50ddf.mp4?t=1787525606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your diner spotless as you clean up the tables and the bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaos! Cooking! Combat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In a post-apocalyptic world where hot dogs are cheap and life is cheaper, you manage the last functioning hot dog diner. Cook hot dogs, brew coffee and serve bizarre orders. Upgrade your diner keep it clean and shoot down raiders who want your hard-earned cash. How many days can you survive in this job in this roguelike job sim?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/c773aea93082961c8bedb8f83c67c321.poster.avif?t=1787525606\" width=117